      <title>Meta自研网络芯片直指AI集群带宽瓶颈</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/aichip/post/20260905/Meta%E8%87%AA%E7%A0%94%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87%E7%9B%B4%E6%8C%87AI%E9%9B%86%E7%BE%A4%E5%B8%A6%E5%AE%BD%E7%93%B6%E9%A2%88/</link>
